<h2 id="concept">1. Design Concept & Layout</h2>
<p>Transforming your bathroom into a restorative sanctuary starts with clean lines, functional layout planning, and high-quality moisture-resistant finishes. This design emphasizes a seamless transition between bathing and grooming zones.</p>

<h2 id="materials">2. Tiles & Material Palette</h2>
<p>Durable stone tiles combined with warm wooden elements create a tactile contrast. Large-format porcelain tiles minimize grout lines for an expansive, easy-to-clean aesthetic.</p>

<h2 id="lighting">3. Ambient & Task Lighting</h2>
<p>Layered lighting—combining dimmable recessed ceiling LEDs with warm backlit vanity mirrors—ensures perfect clarity for daily routines while offering relaxing ambiance for evening soaking.</p>

<h2 id="shop">4. Key Elements to Shop</h2>
<p>Recreate this calm, spa-inspired atmosphere with our curated hardware, vanity fixtures, and luxury textiles below.</p>
