<h2 id="ergonomics">1. Spatial Ergonomics & Desk Orientation</h2>
<p>Designing an inspiring workspace begins with positioning your desk perpendicular to natural light sources to avoid glare while keeping sightlines open. High-quality materials like solid oak and acoustic wool help maintain calm focus throughout the workday.</p>

<h2 id="lighting">2. Layered Task & Ambient Lighting</h2>
<p>Avoid eye strain by pairing diffused 3000K warm ceiling lighting with an adjustable directional desk lamp. Backlit shelving and subtle wall sconces create a welcoming atmosphere for late-afternoon focus.</p>

<h2 id="storage">3. Concealed Cable & Storage Systems</h2>
<p>Keep work surfaces uncluttered using integrated under-desk cord raceways and wall-mounted floating cabinets.</p>

<h2 id="shop">4. Key Elements to Shop</h2>
<p>Recreate this productive workspace with our curated solid oak desks, ergonomic chairs, and task lamps below.</p>
